        <briefdescription>
<para>Handle a disconnection from the underlying transport. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>No further messages should be sent to handleMessage after this is called. Err may contain an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_error" kindref="compound">Error</ref> value indicating unexpected disconnection. This allows clients to log such errors, but no attempt should be made at recovery (which should be handled inside the transport class, if it is supported at all). </para>
